Third-party software bundled with Weave
=======================================

cloudflared
-----------

Weave ships an unmodified copy of Cloudflare's `cloudflared`, which it launches
as a child process to publish a Cloudflare Quick Tunnel for `weave host`. It is
never launched by `weave join`.

    Component: cloudflared
    Version:   2026.8.2
    Source:    https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared
    Release:   https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/tag/2026.8.2
    Copyright: Copyright (C) 2018-2026 Cloudflare, Inc.
    License:   Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

The binary is the official release artifact for this platform, downloaded during
the Weave release build and verified against the SHA-256 digests recorded in
`packaging/cloudflared/SHA256SUMS` in the Weave repository. Weave applies no
patches to it and does not modify its behaviour; it passes only
`tunnel --no-autoupdate --url http://127.0.0.1:<port>`.

